= entry .standings   five one-cell (or one-word) markers for a `Standing`, each a given to import by name
-   detail
+   detail

-       With no import, `Tui.Standing`'s companion supplies `tickStanding`. Every design carries
-       the standing in its *glyph*, not only in its colour, so it survives a monochrome
-       terminal, a redirected stream and a reader who cannot distinguish red from green; and
-       every Unicode design falls back to `asciiStanding` under `gaugeGlyphs.asciiGlyphs`.
+       Sin ninguna importación, el objeto compañero de `Tui.Standing` suministra
+       `tickStanding`. Cada diseño expresa la situación en su *glifo*, no solo en su color, de
+       modo que sobrevive a un terminal monocromo, a un flujo redirigido y a un lector que no
+       distingue el rojo del verde; y todo diseño Unicode recurre a `asciiStanding` bajo
+       `gaugeGlyphs.asciiGlyphs`.

